1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
One disputed certificate can stop production.
Forgefront investigates recovery; the human keeps control.
One recovery room. Evidence before action.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:35,000
The certificate says 120 pieces; receiving says 80.
Two jobs need 70. Inspect the source records.
The disputed material stays on hold.

3
00:00:35,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Muse Spark Open investigates through bounded,
read-only tools. Model identity and latency
come from the actual response.

4
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Muse Wonder explains the tradeoff and counterfactual.
The engine calculates feasibility, hours and costs.
Compare the interpretation with the source facts.

5
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:45,000
The human reviews a feasible plan and types consent.
The single-use envelope binds the operator and snapshot.
Recovery decision accepted. Evidence sealed.

6
00:01:45,000 --> 00:02:15,000
A machine outage invalidates the old decision.
Changed capacity requires a fresh investigation,
review and deliberate human acceptance.

7
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Verify the hash-chained, tamper-evident history.
Export with a strong separate passphrase.
Retain the independent checkpoint separately.

8
00:02:40,000 --> 00:03:00,000
The packet preserves sources, model evidence
and both decisions. Inspect the public source
and contribution inventory.
Forgefront Factory Resilience: evidence before action.
